description: Phase gates, env files, and journal rules for Second Brain
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md and Part A of docs/prompts/second_brain_cursor_prompt_pack.md.
Implement only the phase the user requested. Do not start the next phase in the same turn.
Commit on `main`. Do not create `phase/*` branches. The owner decision in `.cursor/rules/main-and-readme.mdc` supersedes older branch instructions.
After every prompt, update root `README.md` as that rule requires.
The only env files are root `.env` and root `.env.example`, plus an approved root `.env.*.example` when a documented need exists.
Do not log hidden reasoning, tool output, or secrets into prompt_responses.md.
